<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_document" style="font-size:173%;">MM-Nav: Multi-View VLA Model for Robust Visual Navigation via Multi-Expert Learning<span class="ltx_pubnotes"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_thanks"><span class="ltx_note_name">Thanks: </span>*Joint first authors  <math id="m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\dagger" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>†</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dagger</annotation></semantics></math>Corresponding authors</span></span></span></h1>
